Some monsters are able to resist magic some percentage of the
time.  So keep that wand as a last resort.

> What can I do to get out of this shop without getting killed?

If you know teleport scrolls, look for one of them in the shop.  Then
start reading any unknown scroll one by one in the hopes you get
teleported out.  If you run out of scrolls move on to other magical
items in the hopes of getting teleported out.

If you do manage to get out, run for the stairs or quickly explore
for the stairs.  You'll be facing the keystone kops and they are
too powerfull for an XP=2 character to handle.

Your chances are low at this point but worth trying to live.



